{"id":3941,"date":"2020-11-01T16:40:17","date_gmt":"2020-11-01T16:40:17","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/lovetoronto.org\/?page_id=3941"},"modified":"2026-07-09T18:00:34","modified_gmt":"2026-07-09T18:00:34","slug":"faq-3","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/lovetoronto.org\/en\/faq-3\/","title":{"rendered":"\uc790\uc8fc \ubb3b\ub294 \uc9c8\ubb38 &#8211; \ubc95\ub960 \uc0c1\ub2f4 \uc11c\ube44\uc2a4 &#8211; EN"},"content":{"rendered":"<div class=\"wpb-content-wrapper\"><p>[vc_row overlay_dotted=&#8221;&#8221; css=&#8221;.vc_custom_1586889298872{padding-top: 40px !important;padding-bottom: 40px !important;}&#8221;][vc_column][vc_wp_custommenu nav_menu=&#8221;94&#8243; el_class=&#8221;submenu_faq&#8221;][\/vc_column][\/vc_row][vc_row overlay_dotted=&#8221;&#8221;][vc_column css=&#8221;.vc_custom_1507715160194{padding-right: 30px !important;}&#8221; el_class=&#8221;grop-col-padding-none&#8221;]<div class=\"panel-group\" id=\"grop-6ad1925a11fce1\" role=\"tablist\" aria-multiselectable=\"true\"><div class=\"panel panel-default  grop-faq-single\"><div class=\"panel-heading  grop-faq-heading\" role=\"tab\" id=\"grop-faqh-6ad1925a11fce0\"><h4 class=\"panel-title\"><a role=\"button\" data-toggle=\"collapse\" data-parent=\"#grop-6ad1925a11fce1\" href=\"#grop-faq-6ad1925a11fce0\" aria-controls=\"grop-faq-6ad1925a11fce0\">Who is eligible for the Legal Counsel Referral Program?<\/a><\/h4><\/div><div id=\"grop-faq-6ad1925a11fce0\" class=\"panel-collapse collapse  in\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"grop-faqh-6ad1925a11fce0\"><div class=\"panel-body  grop-faq-body\">[vc_column_text]Any Koreans living in Canada are eligible. However, we cannot provide legal counsel referral if you have already retained a lawyer or have your lawsuit in process. [\/vc_column_text]<\/div><\/div><\/div><div class=\"panel panel-default  grop-faq-single\"><div class=\"panel-heading  grop-faq-heading\" role=\"tab\" id=\"grop-faqh-6ad1925a11fce1\"><h4 class=\"panel-title\"><a role=\"button\" data-toggle=\"collapse\" data-parent=\"#grop-6ad1925a11fce1\" href=\"#grop-faq-6ad1925a11fce1\" aria-controls=\"grop-faq-6ad1925a11fce1\">What kinds of services are available from the Legal Counsel Referral Program?<\/a><\/h4><\/div><div id=\"grop-faq-6ad1925a11fce1\" class=\"panel-collapse collapse \" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"grop-faqh-6ad1925a11fce1\"><div class=\"panel-body  grop-faq-body\">[vc_column_text]Love Toronto\u2019s Legal Counsel Referral Program provides you some information and guidelines for better understanding and resolving your case.<br \/>\nIf you are looking for a lawyer to retain, you have to do so by yourself.<br \/>\nYou may retain our attorneys or paralegals, but this must be done through a distinct contract with them splitting from Love Toronto.<br \/>\n[\/vc_column_text]<\/div><\/div><\/div><div class=\"panel panel-default  grop-faq-single\"><div class=\"panel-heading  grop-faq-heading\" role=\"tab\" id=\"grop-faqh-6ad1925a11fce2\"><h4 class=\"panel-title\"><a role=\"button\" data-toggle=\"collapse\" data-parent=\"#grop-6ad1925a11fce1\" href=\"#grop-faq-6ad1925a11fce2\" aria-controls=\"grop-faq-6ad1925a11fce2\">When and where is your program available?<\/a><\/h4><\/div><div id=\"grop-faq-6ad1925a11fce2\" class=\"panel-collapse collapse \" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"grop-faqh-6ad1925a11fce2\"><div class=\"panel-body  grop-faq-body\">[vc_column_text]You will get replies from our lawyers by an email, a phone, or a private 1:1 consultation once your questions regarding your case are submitted through \u201cContact us\u201d on our website. This does not directly deliver your inquiries to lawyers, but it gets transferred to them by Love Toronto.[\/vc_column_text]<\/div><\/div><\/div><div class=\"panel panel-default  grop-faq-single\"><div class=\"panel-heading  grop-faq-heading\" role=\"tab\" id=\"grop-faqh-6ad1925a11fce3\"><h4 class=\"panel-title\"><a role=\"button\" data-toggle=\"collapse\" data-parent=\"#grop-6ad1925a11fce1\" href=\"#grop-faq-6ad1925a11fce3\" aria-controls=\"grop-faq-6ad1925a11fce3\">How long does it usually take to receive legal information from the lawyers?<\/a><\/h4><\/div><div id=\"grop-faq-6ad1925a11fce3\" class=\"panel-collapse collapse \" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"grop-faqh-6ad1925a11fce3\"><div class=\"panel-body  grop-faq-body\">[vc_column_text]It depends on the circumstances. It may take a day to a week. Please email Love Toronto\u2019s program coordinator if you have not received a reply from our lawyer after 2~3 days you submitted your case so that the program coordinator can remind the lawyer. [\/vc_column_text]<\/div><\/div><\/div><div class=\"panel panel-default  grop-faq-single\"><div class=\"panel-heading  grop-faq-heading\" role=\"tab\" id=\"grop-faqh-6ad1925a11fce4\"><h4 class=\"panel-title\"><a role=\"button\" data-toggle=\"collapse\" data-parent=\"#grop-6ad1925a11fce1\" href=\"#grop-faq-6ad1925a11fce4\" aria-controls=\"grop-faq-6ad1925a11fce4\">What resources are available for me if I can\u2019t afford attorney\u2019s fees?<\/a><\/h4><\/div><div id=\"grop-faq-6ad1925a11fce4\" class=\"panel-collapse collapse \" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"grop-faqh-6ad1925a11fce4\"><div class=\"panel-body  grop-faq-body\">[vc_column_text]If you need financial assistance for retaining a lawyer, you may find some help from Legal Aid Clinic (<a href=\"https:\/\/www.legalaid.on.ca\/legal-clinics\/\">https:\/\/www.legalaid.on.ca\/legal-clinics\/<\/a>) or Community Legal Clinic (<a href=\"https:\/\/www.cleo.on.ca\/en\/publications\/ontario\/toronto-and-area\">https:\/\/www.cleo.on.ca\/en\/publications\/ontario\/toronto-and-area<\/a>).[\/vc_column_text]<\/div><\/div><\/div><div class=\"panel panel-default  grop-faq-single\"><div class=\"panel-heading  grop-faq-heading\" role=\"tab\" id=\"grop-faqh-6ad1925a11fce5\"><h4 class=\"panel-title\"><a role=\"button\" data-toggle=\"collapse\" data-parent=\"#grop-6ad1925a11fce1\" href=\"#grop-faq-6ad1925a11fce5\" aria-controls=\"grop-faq-6ad1925a11fce5\">How can I apply for a Legal Counsel Referral Program?<\/a><\/h4><\/div><div id=\"grop-faq-6ad1925a11fce5\" class=\"panel-collapse collapse \" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"grop-faqh-6ad1925a11fce5\"><div class=\"panel-body  grop-faq-body\">[vc_column_text]You can apply for the Legal Counsel Referral Program through \u201cContact us\u201d from our website. Please make sure you have detailed and accurate information of your situation, references (if you have), as well as you and your counterparty.[\/vc_column_text]<\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div>[\/vc_column][\/vc_row]<\/p>\n<\/div>","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"[vc_row overlay_dotted=&#8221;&#8221; css=&#8221;.vc_custom_1586889298872{padding-top: 40px !important;padding-bottom: 40px !important;}&#8221;][vc_column][vc_wp_custommenu nav_menu=&#8221;94&#8243; el_class=&#8221;submenu_faq&#8221;][\/vc_column][\/vc_row][vc_row overlay_dotted=&#8221;&#8221;][vc_column css=&#8221;.vc_custom_1507715160194{padding-right: 30px !important;}&#8221; el_class=&#8221;grop-col-padding-none&#8221;][\/vc_column][\/vc_row]","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":0,"parent":0,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"give_campaign_id":0,"footnotes":""},"class_list":["post-3941","page","type-page","status-publish","hentry"],"aioseo_notices":[],"aioseo_head":"\n\t\t<!-- All in One SEO 5.0.0.1 - aioseo.com -->\n\t<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Love Toronto Psychotherapeutic Counsel Legal Counsel Adult Day Program Who is eligible for the Legal Counsel Referral Program? Any Koreans living in Canada are eligible. However, we cannot provide legal counsel referral if you have already retained a lawyer or have your lawsuit in process. What kinds of services are available from the Legal Counsel\" \/>\n\t<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"max-image-preview:large\" \/>\n\t<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https:\/\/lovetoronto.org\/en\/fa